    "Regional leaders and officials expressed hopes that the honors granted to figures like R.M. Margono will inspire the younger generation."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto officially awarded the title of National Hero to 19 prominent figures in a formal ceremony held at the State Palace. The list of recipients features notable individuals from various fields of service, including former National Police Chief Hoegeng Iman Santoso, who is widely recognized for his service. Other figures honored include the founder of Pekanbaru known as Marhum Pekan, military guerrilla leader Lieutenant Colonel Mochammad Sroedji, the Paser war leader Sultan Ibrahim Chaliludin, and the Islamic scholar Kiai Abbas, often referred to as the Tiger of the West. Following the announcement, various regional officials, including the Governor of Central Java, publicly commended the recognition of these historical figures, such as R.M. Margono, and encouraged the youth to emulate their spirit of struggle. The ceremony marks a significant event in the 2026 national commemorative calendar.",
